  "nonclaims": [
    "This evaluation-only run does not retrain or change the frozen checkpoints.",
    "The decoder injects the qualified transform's own core contract, so exact-L1 under it does not measure whether the model alone learned that core; it changes which SMILES is produced, never how it is judged.",
